{"id":"588ba1ca83000a13","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness.md","title":"GL Kripke soundness","display":"thm-gl-kripke-soundness — GL Kripke soundness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness"],"display":"thm-gl-kripke-soundness — GL Kripke soundness","depends_on":["[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, discussion after Definition 2.2, printed p. 478, PDF p. 490","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"Full local Lob axiom maximal-counterexample argument, K/PTaut and closure induction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-kripke-soundness — GL Kripke soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, discussion after Definition 2.2, printed p. 478, PDF p. 490"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Full local Lob axiom maximal-counterexample argument, K/PTaut and closure induction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_m\">\\(\\models_m\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源明确断言相应 Kripke 模型对 L 可靠；这里另给出完整局部论证。命题重言式与 K 公理由满足子句直接成立。验证 Löb 公理时，设 w 满足 □(□B→B) 但不满足 □B。令 X 为满足 wRv 且 v 不满足 B 的世界集合，则 X 非空。取 X 的 R 极大元 v。若 vRu，则传递性给出 wRu；若 u 不满足 B，则 u 属于 X，违反极大性。因此 v 满足 □B。由 w 的假设及 wRv，v 又满足 □B→B，于是 v 满足 B，矛盾。分离规则保持全世界有效性；若 B 在每个世界成立，则每个世界的所有后继均满足 B，所以 □B 也全世界成立。按 H_n 的构造归纳即得结论。该证明只证明可靠性，不承担模态完备性或 Solovay 算术完备性的证明义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 见 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$、$R\\subseteq W^2$、$V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)$，$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)$ 以及 $\\models_m$ 见 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A.","display":true}],"bytes":2156,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness|thm-gl-kripke-soundness — GL Kripke soundness]]"},{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-thm-gl-kripke-soundness]] 及其上游的 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$、$\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)$、$\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m B$ 和 $\\mathcal M\\models_m B$。关系仍按 $R(u,v)\\Leftrightarrow\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R$ 使用。"}],"outgoing":["3fd94ba56d864509","91aa38d1fd431425"]}